INFO:root:Session ID: dc98fa3b-aee5-4e54-91b6-bb14775b63c3, AI Response: FFCS stands for Fully Flexible Credit System. It is a teaching and learning approach introduced by VIT (Vellore Institute of Technology) to provide students with complete freedom in tailoring their course and learning environment.

In the FFCS system, students have the flexibility to:

1. Prepare their own timetable with the specific courses they intend to do in a semester.
2. Choose the timings of classes and the professors they want to learn from.
3. Pursue their other interests and passions alongside their academic coursework.

The FFCS system aims to accommodate the wants and needs of the entire student community, making learning a more personalized and enjoyable experience.
